<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day bills worth 600 million pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day bills worth 600 million pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 600 million pounds for auction on December 25 and issue on December 26, when 91-day bills worth 602.050 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 10.063 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 Egyptian pounds)</p>
</text>
